+        # BUGFIX (Brake ruling 20 Jul): the sit-out / VWAP-warmup / high-impact-pre-open
+        # blocks must gate RESTING-ORDER FILLS too, not only NEW triggers — otherwise an
+        # order placed just before the window fills inside it. Holds the order (no fill this
+        # bar); it can still fill after the window, or cancel at t_cancel / window-end.
+        if cfg.no_trade_start is not None and cfg.no_trade_start <= tod < cfg.no_trade_end:
